 RowBox[{"Print", 
  "[", "\"\<We now wish to pick some more appropriate variables. We start by \
defining e=v^2/by, in which case we can express the equations in the \
following way. The first three lines are the definitions in terms of e, and \
the next three are a check that they agree (so the last three should be zero)\
\>\"", "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
